(497,287,$mw$DDEB81A4C053EE0EA506663F7D94EA2940978433DE3FC730A5F0EEC9620388D9$mw$,$mw$beb339c5103cf489470fee1b4145fc53$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":287,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":11,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"أوجد \\(f'(3)\\) للدالة \\(f(x)=4x^{4}\\).","TitleEn":"Find f'(3) for \\(f(x)=4x^{4}\\).","QuestionTextAr":"أوجد \\(f'(3)\\) للدالة \\(f(x)=4x^{4}\\).","QuestionTextEn":"Find f'(3) for \\(f(x)=4x^{4}\\).","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: مشتقة أ س^ن هي أ ن س^(ن−1). في f(س) = 4س^4 تكون f'(س) = 4 × 4س^3 = 16س^3. عند س = 3 نحسب f'(3) = 16 × 3^3 = 16 × 27 = 432. نشتق أولاً ثم نعوّض بقيمة س.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Power rule: d(ax^n)/dx = anx^(n−1). For f(x) = 4x^4, f'(x) = 4 × 4x^3 = 16x^3. Then f'(3) = 16 × 3^3 = 16 × 27 = 432. Differentiate first, then substitute the given x.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1137,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"433","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1138,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"435","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1139,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"430","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1140,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"432","IsCorrect":true}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابدأ بقاعدة اشتقاق القوى.","En":"Start with the power rule."},{"Ar":"اشتق الحدود أولاً، ثم عوّض المدخل إن كان المطلوب قيمة عددية.","En":"Differentiate the terms first, then substitute the input if a numerical value is requested."}],"Title":{"Ar":"أوجد \\(f'(3)\\) للدالة \\(f(x)=4x^{4}\\).","En":"Find f'(3) for \\(f(x)=4x^{4}\\)."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الخيار لا يساوي حاصل ضرب معامل المشتقة 16 في 27؛ أعد حساب القوة والضرب.","En":"This choice is not the derivative coefficient 16 times 27; recheck exponentiation and multiplication."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"433"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الخيار لا يساوي حاصل ضرب معامل المشتقة 16 في 27؛ أعد حساب القوة والضرب.","En":"This choice is not the derivative coefficient 16 times 27; recheck exponentiation and multiplication."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"435"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الخيار لا يساوي حاصل ضرب معامل المشتقة 16 في 27؛ أعد حساب القوة والضرب.","En":"This choice is not the derivative coefficient 16 times 27; recheck exponentiation and multiplication."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"430"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"432"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"أوجد \\(f'(3)\\) للدالة \\(f(x)=4x^{4}\\).","En":"Find f'(3) for \\(f(x)=4x^{4}\\)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"قاعدة القوة وخطية الاشتقاق: نشتق كل حد على حدة، ومشتقة الثابت صفر.","En":"Power rule and derivative linearity: differentiate each term separately; constants differentiate to zero."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"طبق قاعدة القوة: $f'(x)=16x^{3}$.","En":"Apply the power rule: $f'(x)=16x^{3}$."},{"Ar":"عوّض $x=3$: $16\\times3^{3}=432$.","En":"Substitute $x=3$: $16\\times3^{3}=432$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$432$","En":"$432$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تنس ضرب المعامل في الأس أو تنس إنقاص الأس.","En":"Do not forget to multiply by the exponent or lower it."},"FormulaLatex":"\\frac{d}{dx}(ax^n)=anx^{n-1}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$f'(x)=16x^{3},\\quad f'(3)=432$","En":"$f'(x)=16x^{3},\\quad f'(3)=432$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$4\\times4\\times3^{3}=432$","En":"$4\\times4\\times3^{3}=432$"}},"TrackIds":[11],"CategoryId":11,"PrimarySkillId":49,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابدأ بقاعدة اشتقاق القوى.","En":"Start with the power rule."},{"Ar":"اشتق الحدود أولاً، ثم عوّض المدخل إن كان المطلوب قيمة عددية.","En":"Differentiate the terms first, then substitute the input if a numerical value is requested."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"قاعدة القوة وخطية الاشتقاق: نشتق كل حد على حدة، ومشتقة الثابت صفر.","En":"Power rule and derivative linearity: differentiate each term separately; constants differentiate to zero."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"طبق قاعدة القوة: $f'(x)=16x^{3}$.","En":"Apply the power rule: $f'(x)=16x^{3}$."},{"Ar":"عوّض $x=3$: $16\\times3^{3}=432$.","En":"Substitute $x=3$: $16\\times3^{3}=432$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$432$","En":"$432$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تنس ضرب المعامل في الأس أو تنس إنقاص الأس.","En":"Do not forget to multiply by the exponent or lower it."},"FormulaLatex":"\\frac{d}{dx}(ax^n)=anx^{n-1}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$f'(x)=16x^{3},\\quad f'(3)=432$","En":"$f'(x)=16x^{3},\\quad f'(3)=432$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$4\\times4\\times3^{3}=432$","En":"$4\\times4\\times3^{3}=432$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الخيار لا يساوي حاصل ضرب معامل المشتقة 16 في 27؛ أعد حساب القوة والضرب.","En":"This choice is not the derivative coefficient 16 times 27; recheck exponentiation and multiplication."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الخيار لا يساوي حاصل ضرب معامل المشتقة 16 في 27؛ أعد حساب القوة والضرب.","En":"This choice is not the derivative coefficient 16 times 27; recheck exponentiation and multiplication."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الخيار لا يساوي حاصل ضرب معامل المشتقة 16 في 27؛ أعد حساب القوة والضرب.","En":"This choice is not the derivative coefficient 16 times 27; recheck exponentiation and multiplication."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$قاعدة القوة وخطية الاشتقاق: نشتق كل حد على حدة، ومشتقة الثابت صفر.

$\frac{d}{dx}(ax^n)=anx^{n-1}$

1. طبق قاعدة القوة: $f'(x)=16x^{3}$.

2. عوّض $x=3$: $16\times3^{3}=432$.

$f'(x)=16x^{3},\quad f'(3)=432$

$432$ بلا وحدة قياس

$4\times4\times3^{3}=432$

لا تنس ضرب المعامل في الأس أو تنس إنقاص الأس.$mw$,$mw$Power rule and derivative linearity: differentiate each term separately; constants differentiate to zero.

$\frac{d}{dx}(ax^n)=anx^{n-1}$

1. Apply the power rule: $f'(x)=16x^{3}$.

2. Substitute $x=3$: $16\times3^{3}=432$.

$f'(x)=16x^{3},\quad f'(3)=432$

$432$ Dimensionless

$4\times4\times3^{3}=432$

Do not forget to multiply by the exponent or lower it.$mw$),
(498,288,$mw$84067EB8940B4C3F3979996B1B75583AFE2A25AB7250F4CCCAEDE18F77AB8621$mw$,$mw$3a92a377b1fa0ad77d4d282f552223d4$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":288,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":11,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"احسب \\(\\int 9x^{2}\\,dx\\).","TitleEn":"Compute \\(\\int 9x^{2}\\,dx\\).","QuestionTextAr":"احسب \\(\\int 9x^{2}\\,dx\\).","QuestionTextEn":"Compute \\(\\int 9x^{2}\\,dx\\).","DetailedSolutionAr":"قانون التكامل غير المحدد للقوى: ∫أ س^ن dس = أ × س^(ن+1)/(ن+1) + C، ما دام ن ≠ −1. لدينا ∫9س^2 dس، نزيد الأس إلى 3 ونقسم المعامل على 3: (9/3)س^3 + C = 3س^3 + C. نضيف ثابت التكامل C لأن التكامل غير محدد.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Indefinite power-integration rule: ∫a x^n dx = a x^(n+1)/(n+1) + C when n ≠ −1. For ∫9x^2 dx, raise the exponent to 3 and divide the coefficient by 3: (9/3)x^3 + C = 3x^3 + C. Include integration constant C.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1141,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"3x^{2}+C","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1142,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"9x^{2}+C","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1143,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"3x^{3}+C","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1144,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"9x^{3}+C","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"استعمل عكس قاعدة الاشتقاق للقوى.","En":"Use the inverse of the derivative power rule."},{"Ar":"ارفع الأس واحداً ثم اقسم المعامل على الأس الجديد.","En":"Increase the exponent by one and divide the coefficient by the new exponent."}],"Title":{"Ar":"احسب \\(\\int 9x^{2}\\,dx\\).","En":"Compute \\(\\int 9x^{2}\\,dx\\)."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"مشتقة هذا الخيار هي $6x^{1}$ لا $9x^{2}$.","En":"This option differentiates to $6x^{1}$, not $9x^{2}$."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"3x^{2}+C"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"مشتقة هذا الخيار هي $18x^{1}$ لا $9x^{2}$.","En":"This option differentiates to $18x^{1}$, not $9x^{2}$."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"9x^{2}+C"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"3x^{3}+C"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"مشتقة هذا الخيار هي $27x^{2}$ لا $9x^{2}$.","En":"This option differentiates to $27x^{2}$, not $9x^{2}$."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"9x^{3}+C"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"احسب \\(\\int 9x^{2}\\,dx\\).","En":"Compute \\(\\int 9x^{2}\\,dx\\)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"التكامل غير المحدد يعكس الاشتقاق؛ نرفع الأس واحداً ونقسم على الأس الجديد ونضيف ثابت التكامل.","En":"Indefinite integration reverses differentiation: increase the power by one, divide by the new power, and add a constant."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"ارفع الأس 2 إلى 3؛ قاعدة القوة صالحة لأن $n\\ne-1$.","En":"Raise exponent 2 to 3; the power rule applies because $n\\ne-1$."},{"Ar":"اقسم المعامل 9 على 3 وأضف ثابت التكامل $C$.","En":"Divide coefficient 9 by 3 and add integration constant $C$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$3x^{3}+C$","En":"$3x^{3}+C$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تنس القسمة على الأس الجديد أو ثابت التكامل.","En":"Do not omit division by the new exponent or the integration constant."},"FormulaLatex":"\\int ax^n\\,dx=\\frac{a}{n+1}x^{n+1}+C\\quad(n\\ne-1)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\int 9x^{2}\\,dx=\\frac{9}{3}x^{3}+C$","En":"$\\int 9x^{2}\\,dx=\\frac{9}{3}x^{3}+C$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(3x^{3}+C)'=9x^{2}$","En":"$(3x^{3}+C)'=9x^{2}$"}},"TrackIds":[12],"CategoryId":11,"PrimarySkillId":50,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"استعمل عكس قاعدة الاشتقاق للقوى.","En":"Use the inverse of the derivative power rule."},{"Ar":"ارفع الأس واحداً ثم اقسم المعامل على الأس الجديد.","En":"Increase the exponent by one and divide the coefficient by the new exponent."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"التكامل غير المحدد يعكس الاشتقاق؛ نرفع الأس واحداً ونقسم على الأس الجديد ونضيف ثابت التكامل.","En":"Indefinite integration reverses differentiation: increase the power by one, divide by the new power, and add a constant."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"ارفع الأس 2 إلى 3؛ قاعدة القوة صالحة لأن $n\\ne-1$.","En":"Raise exponent 2 to 3; the power rule applies because $n\\ne-1$."},{"Ar":"اقسم المعامل 9 على 3 وأضف ثابت التكامل $C$.","En":"Divide coefficient 9 by 3 and add integration constant $C$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$3x^{3}+C$","En":"$3x^{3}+C$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تنس القسمة على الأس الجديد أو ثابت التكامل.","En":"Do not omit division by the new exponent or the integration constant."},"FormulaLatex":"\\int ax^n\\,dx=\\frac{a}{n+1}x^{n+1}+C\\quad(n\\ne-1)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\int 9x^{2}\\,dx=\\frac{9}{3}x^{3}+C$","En":"$\\int 9x^{2}\\,dx=\\frac{9}{3}x^{3}+C$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(3x^{3}+C)'=9x^{2}$","En":"$(3x^{3}+C)'=9x^{2}$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"مشتقة هذا الخيار هي $6x^{1}$ لا $9x^{2}$.","En":"This option differentiates to $6x^{1}$, not $9x^{2}$."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"مشتقة هذا الخيار هي $18x^{1}$ لا $9x^{2}$.","En":"This option differentiates to $18x^{1}$, not $9x^{2}$."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"مشتقة هذا الخيار هي $27x^{2}$ لا $9x^{2}$.","En":"This option differentiates to $27x^{2}$, not $9x^{2}$."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$التكامل غير المحدد يعكس الاشتقاق؛ نرفع الأس واحداً ونقسم على الأس الجديد ونضيف ثابت التكامل.

$\int ax^n\,dx=\frac{a}{n+1}x^{n+1}+C\quad(n\ne-1)$

1. ارفع الأس 2 إلى 3؛ قاعدة القوة صالحة لأن $n\ne-1$.

2. اقسم المعامل 9 على 3 وأضف ثابت التكامل $C$.

$\int 9x^{2}\,dx=\frac{9}{3}x^{3}+C$

$3x^{3}+C$ بلا وحدة قياس

$(3x^{3}+C)'=9x^{2}$

لا تنس القسمة على الأس الجديد أو ثابت التكامل.$mw$,$mw$Indefinite integration reverses differentiation: increase the power by one, divide by the new power, and add a constant.

$\int ax^n\,dx=\frac{a}{n+1}x^{n+1}+C\quad(n\ne-1)$

1. Raise exponent 2 to 3; the power rule applies because $n\ne-1$.

2. Divide coefficient 9 by 3 and add integration constant $C$.

$\int 9x^{2}\,dx=\frac{9}{3}x^{3}+C$

$3x^{3}+C$ Dimensionless

$(3x^{3}+C)'=9x^{2}$

Do not omit division by the new exponent or the integration constant.$mw$),
(499,289,$mw$8E95C83383D99C549A75CFE6DD259892C85FBE209D4A3621BA91389088F82405$mw$,$mw$7541ba68fdaa8592d950f79a8009b40a$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":289,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":11,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"احسب \\(\\int_0^{4} 6t\\,dt\\).","TitleEn":"Evaluate \\(\\int_0^{4} 6t\\,dt\\).","QuestionTextAr":"احسب \\(\\int_0^{4} 6t\\,dt\\).","QuestionTextEn":"Evaluate \\(\\int_0^{4} 6t\\,dt\\).","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: مبرهنة التكامل الأساسية؛ التكامل المحدد من 0 إلى 4 للدالة 6t يساوي F(4) − F(0)، حيث F(t) = (6/2)t² = 3t². بالتعويض: 3 × 4² − 3 × 0² = 3 × 16 = 48.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Fundamental Theorem of Calculus: Evaluate ∫₀^4 6t dt as F(4) − F(0), where F(t) = (6/2)t² = 3t². Substitute: 3 × 4² − 3 × 0² = 3 × 16 = 48.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1145,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"46","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1146,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"48","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1147,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"49","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1148,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"51","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"أوجد دالة أصلية أولاً.","En":"Find an antiderivative first."},{"Ar":"عوّض حد التكامل الأعلى والأدنى في الدالة الأصلية ثم اطرح.","En":"Evaluate the antiderivative at both integration bounds and subtract."}],"Title":{"Ar":"احسب \\(\\int_0^{4} 6t\\,dt\\).","En":"Evaluate \\(\\int_0^{4} 6t\\,dt\\)."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الناتج لا يساوي مساحة المثلث ذي القاعدة 4 والارتفاع 24؛ راجع التعويض في الحدين.","En":"This is not the triangular area with base 4 and height 24; check both bounds."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"46"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"48"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الناتج لا يساوي مساحة المثلث ذي القاعدة 4 والارتفاع 24؛ راجع التعويض في الحدين.","En":"This is not the triangular area with base 4 and height 24; check both bounds."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"49"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الناتج لا يساوي مساحة المثلث ذي القاعدة 4 والارتفاع 24؛ راجع التعويض في الحدين.","En":"This is not the triangular area with base 4 and height 24; check both bounds."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"51"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"احسب \\(\\int_0^{4} 6t\\,dt\\).","En":"Evaluate \\(\\int_0^{4} 6t\\,dt\\)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"مبرهنة التفاضل والتكامل الأساسية: نحسب دالة أصلية ثم نطرح قيمتها عند الحد الأدنى من الأعلى.","En":"The fundamental theorem of calculus: find an antiderivative and subtract its value at the lower bound from the upper bound."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"دالة أصلية للتعبير هي $F(t)=3t^2$.","En":"An antiderivative is $F(t)=3t^2$."},{"Ar":"احسب الفرق: $F(4)-F(0)=3\\times4^2=48$.","En":"Evaluate the difference: $F(4)-F(0)=3\\times4^2=48$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$48$","En":"$48$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تنس طرح قيمة الحد الأدنى أو تترك ثابت التكامل في الناتج المحدد.","En":"Do not omit the lower-bound value or leave an integration constant in a definite result."},"FormulaLatex":"\\int_a^b f(t)\\,dt=F(b)-F(a)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\left[3t^2\\right]_0^{4}=3(4^2-0)=48$","En":"$\\left[3t^2\\right]_0^{4}=3(4^2-0)=48$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"مشتقة $F$ هي $6t$، ومساحة المثلث تحت المستقيم تساوي $\\frac12\\times4\\times24=48$.","En":"The derivative of $F$ is $6t$; the triangular area is $\\frac12\\times4\\times24=48$."}},"TrackIds":[12],"CategoryId":11,"PrimarySkillId":51,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"أوجد دالة أصلية أولاً.","En":"Find an antiderivative first."},{"Ar":"عوّض حد التكامل الأعلى والأدنى في الدالة الأصلية ثم اطرح.","En":"Evaluate the antiderivative at both integration bounds and subtract."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"مبرهنة التفاضل والتكامل الأساسية: نحسب دالة أصلية ثم نطرح قيمتها عند الحد الأدنى من الأعلى.","En":"The fundamental theorem of calculus: find an antiderivative and subtract its value at the lower bound from the upper bound."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"دالة أصلية للتعبير هي $F(t)=3t^2$.","En":"An antiderivative is $F(t)=3t^2$."},{"Ar":"احسب الفرق: $F(4)-F(0)=3\\times4^2=48$.","En":"Evaluate the difference: $F(4)-F(0)=3\\times4^2=48$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$48$","En":"$48$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تنس طرح قيمة الحد الأدنى أو تترك ثابت التكامل في الناتج المحدد.","En":"Do not omit the lower-bound value or leave an integration constant in a definite result."},"FormulaLatex":"\\int_a^b f(t)\\,dt=F(b)-F(a)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\left[3t^2\\right]_0^{4}=3(4^2-0)=48$","En":"$\\left[3t^2\\right]_0^{4}=3(4^2-0)=48$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"مشتقة $F$ هي $6t$، ومساحة المثلث تحت المستقيم تساوي $\\frac12\\times4\\times24=48$.","En":"The derivative of $F$ is $6t$; the triangular area is $\\frac12\\times4\\times24=48$."}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الناتج لا يساوي مساحة المثلث ذي القاعدة 4 والارتفاع 24؛ راجع التعويض في الحدين.","En":"This is not the triangular area with base 4 and height 24; check both bounds."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الناتج لا يساوي مساحة المثلث ذي القاعدة 4 والارتفاع 24؛ راجع التعويض في الحدين.","En":"This is not the triangular area with base 4 and height 24; check both bounds."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الناتج لا يساوي مساحة المثلث ذي القاعدة 4 والارتفاع 24؛ راجع التعويض في الحدين.","En":"This is not the triangular area with base 4 and height 24; check both bounds."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$مبرهنة التفاضل والتكامل الأساسية: نحسب دالة أصلية ثم نطرح قيمتها عند الحد الأدنى من الأعلى.

$\int_a^b f(t)\,dt=F(b)-F(a)$

1. دالة أصلية للتعبير هي $F(t)=3t^2$.

2. احسب الفرق: $F(4)-F(0)=3\times4^2=48$.

$\left[3t^2\right]_0^{4}=3(4^2-0)=48$

$48$ بلا وحدة قياس

مشتقة $F$ هي $6t$، ومساحة المثلث تحت المستقيم تساوي $\frac12\times4\times24=48$.

لا تنس طرح قيمة الحد الأدنى أو تترك ثابت التكامل في الناتج المحدد.$mw$,$mw$The fundamental theorem of calculus: find an antiderivative and subtract its value at the lower bound from the upper bound.

$\int_a^b f(t)\,dt=F(b)-F(a)$

1. An antiderivative is $F(t)=3t^2$.

2. Evaluate the difference: $F(4)-F(0)=3\times4^2=48$.

$\left[3t^2\right]_0^{4}=3(4^2-0)=48$

$48$ Dimensionless

The derivative of $F$ is $6t$; the triangular area is $\frac12\times4\times24=48$.

Do not omit the lower-bound value or leave an integration constant in a definite result.$mw$),
(500,290,$mw$48083AE90D2C6DA4D67BE39290C24A7F509A88738F2FDBE45FA4B7637BD8393A$mw$,$mw$04850dae36175681e560f1f612344718$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":290,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":12,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"كم طريقة لاختيار طالبين من 5 طلاب دون ترتيب؟","TitleEn":"How many unordered pairs can be selected from 5 students?","QuestionTextAr":"كم طريقة لاختيار طالبين من 5 طلاب دون ترتيب؟","QuestionTextEn":"How many unordered pairs can be selected from 5 students?","DetailedSolutionAr":"الاختيار دون ترتيب يُحسب بالتوافيق؛ نختار طالبين من 5، لذا $\\binom{5}{2}=\\frac{5\\times4}{2}=10$ طريقة.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Because order does not matter, use combinations: choosing two students from 5 gives $\\binom{5}{2}=\\frac{5\\times4}{2}=10$ ways.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1149,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"13","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1150,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"8","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1151,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"10","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1152,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"11","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"ترتيب الطالبين غير مهم.","En":"The order of the two students is irrelevant."},{"Ar":"احسب الاختيارات المرتبة ثم أزل التكرار الناشئ عن تبديل الطالبين.","En":"Count ordered choices and remove duplicates caused by swapping students."}],"Title":{"Ar":"كم طريقة لاختيار طالبين من 5 طلاب دون ترتيب؟","En":"How many unordered pairs can be selected from 5 students?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا العدد يقابل 26 اختياراً مرتباً، بينما العدد الصحيح للاختيارات المرتبة 20.","En":"This implies 26 ordered selections, but there are 20."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"13"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا العدد يقابل 16 اختياراً مرتباً، بينما العدد الصحيح للاختيارات المرتبة 20.","En":"This implies 16 ordered selections, but there are 20."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"8"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"10"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا العدد يقابل 22 اختياراً مرتباً، بينما العدد الصحيح للاختيارات المرتبة 20.","En":"This implies 22 ordered selections, but there are 20."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"11"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"كم طريقة لاختيار طالبين من 5 طلاب دون ترتيب؟","En":"How many unordered pairs can be selected from 5 students?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"اختيار زوج دون ترتيب يعني أن كل زوج مرتب يُحسب مرتين؛ نقسم على 2.","En":"For unordered pairs each ordered pair is counted twice, so divide by two."},"Unit":{"Ar":"طريقة","En":"Ways"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"للاختيار الأول 5 إمكانات، وللثاني 4 بعد استبعاد الأول.","En":"There are 5 choices for the first student and 4 for the second, excluding the first."},{"Ar":"كل زوج غير مرتب يُعد مرتين؛ اقسم 20 على 2.","En":"Each unordered pair is counted twice; divide 20 by 2."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$10$","En":"$10$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تحسب ترتيب الطالبين على أنه اختيار جديد.","En":"Do not count the reversed order as another selection."},"FormulaLatex":"\\binom n2=\\frac{n(n-1)}{2}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\binom{5}2=\\frac{5(5-1)}2=10$","En":"$\\binom{5}2=\\frac{5(5-1)}2=10$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$10\\times2=20$","En":"$10\\times2=20$"}},"TrackIds":[11],"CategoryId":12,"PrimarySkillId":56,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"ترتيب الطالبين غير مهم.","En":"The order of the two students is irrelevant."},{"Ar":"احسب الاختيارات المرتبة ثم أزل التكرار الناشئ عن تبديل الطالبين.","En":"Count ordered choices and remove duplicates caused by swapping students."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"اختيار زوج دون ترتيب يعني أن كل زوج مرتب يُحسب مرتين؛ نقسم على 2.","En":"For unordered pairs each ordered pair is counted twice, so divide by two."},"Unit":{"Ar":"طريقة","En":"Ways"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"للاختيار الأول 5 إمكانات، وللثاني 4 بعد استبعاد الأول.","En":"There are 5 choices for the first student and 4 for the second, excluding the first."},{"Ar":"كل زوج غير مرتب يُعد مرتين؛ اقسم 20 على 2.","En":"Each unordered pair is counted twice; divide 20 by 2."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$10$","En":"$10$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تحسب ترتيب الطالبين على أنه اختيار جديد.","En":"Do not count the reversed order as another selection."},"FormulaLatex":"\\binom n2=\\frac{n(n-1)}{2}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\binom{5}2=\\frac{5(5-1)}2=10$","En":"$\\binom{5}2=\\frac{5(5-1)}2=10$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$10\\times2=20$","En":"$10\\times2=20$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا العدد يقابل 26 اختياراً مرتباً، بينما العدد الصحيح للاختيارات المرتبة 20.","En":"This implies 26 ordered selections, but there are 20."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا العدد يقابل 16 اختياراً مرتباً، بينما العدد الصحيح للاختيارات المرتبة 20.","En":"This implies 16 ordered selections, but there are 20."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا العدد يقابل 22 اختياراً مرتباً، بينما العدد الصحيح للاختيارات المرتبة 20.","En":"This implies 22 ordered selections, but there are 20."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$اختيار زوج دون ترتيب يعني أن كل زوج مرتب يُحسب مرتين؛ نقسم على 2.

$\binom n2=\frac{n(n-1)}{2}$

1. للاختيار الأول 5 إمكانات، وللثاني 4 بعد استبعاد الأول.

2. كل زوج غير مرتب يُعد مرتين؛ اقسم 20 على 2.

$\binom{5}2=\frac{5(5-1)}2=10$

$10$ طريقة

$10\times2=20$

لا تحسب ترتيب الطالبين على أنه اختيار جديد.$mw$,$mw$For unordered pairs each ordered pair is counted twice, so divide by two.

$\binom n2=\frac{n(n-1)}{2}$

1. There are 5 choices for the first student and 4 for the second, excluding the first.

2. Each unordered pair is counted twice; divide 20 by 2.

$\binom{5}2=\frac{5(5-1)}2=10$

$10$ Ways

$10\times2=20$

Do not count the reversed order as another selection.$mw$),
(502,293,$mw$355BFDA8C0500DB97C775125A3694570FAAE997E65F3602E938556FDB7A8AF30$mw$,$mw$fb4b7bae799070d0a8b1d3819faf2fb2$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":293,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":9,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"ما حاصل ضرب جذري \\(x^2-11x+28=0\\)؟","TitleEn":"What is the product of the roots of \\(x^2-11x+28=0\\)?","QuestionTextAr":"ما حاصل ضرب جذري \\(x^2-11x+28=0\\)؟","QuestionTextEn":"What is the product of the roots of \\(x^2-11x+28=0\\)?","DetailedSolutionAr":"قانون فييتا لمعادلة تربيعية أ س² + ب س + ج = 0: حاصل ضرب الجذرين = ج ÷ أ. في س² − 11س + 28 = 0 معامل س² هو 1 والحد الثابت 28، لذا حاصل الضرب = 28 ÷ 1 = 28. التحقق: التحليل (س − 4)(س − 7) يعطي الجذرين 4 و7 ومنتجهما 28.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Vieta's theorem: For ax² + bx + c = 0, the product of the two roots is c/a. In x² − 11x + 28 = 0, a = 1 and c = 28, so root product = 28/1 = 28. Check: factoring as (x − 4)(x − 7) yields roots 4, 7 with product 28.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1161,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"28","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1162,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"29","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1163,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"31","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1164,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"26","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"استعمل علاقات فييتا أو اقرأ الجذور من العوامل.","En":"Use Vieta's formulas or read the roots from the factors."},{"Ar":"اقسم الحد الثابت على معامل المربع.","En":"Divide the constant term by the leading coefficient."}],"Title":{"Ar":"ما حاصل ضرب جذري \\(x^2-11x+28=0\\)؟","En":"What is the product of the roots of \\(x^2-11x+28=0\\)?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"28"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"معامل المربع يساوي 1؛ ضرب الخيار 29 في هذا المعامل لا يعيد الحد الثابت 28.","En":"The leading coefficient is 1; multiplying 29 by it does not recover constant 28."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"29"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"معامل المربع يساوي 1؛ ضرب الخيار 31 في هذا المعامل لا يعيد الحد الثابت 28.","En":"The leading coefficient is 1; multiplying 31 by it does not recover constant 28."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"31"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"معامل المربع يساوي 1؛ ضرب الخيار 26 في هذا المعامل لا يعيد الحد الثابت 28.","En":"The leading coefficient is 1; multiplying 26 by it does not recover constant 28."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"26"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"ما حاصل ضرب جذري \\(x^2-11x+28=0\\)؟","En":"What is the product of the roots of \\(x^2-11x+28=0\\)?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"علاقات فييتا تربط حاصل ضرب الجذور بالحد الثابت ومعامل المربع.","En":"Vieta's formulas connect the product of roots to the constant and quadratic coefficient."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"معامل $x^2$ هو $a=1$ والحد الثابت $c=28$.","En":"The leading coefficient is $a=1$ and the constant is $c=28$."},{"Ar":"طبق علاقة فييتا: $r_1r_2=\\frac{28}{1}=28$.","En":"Apply Vieta's relation: $r_1r_2=\\frac{28}{1}=28$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$28$","En":"$28$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط قانون المجموع بقانون الجداء.","En":"Do not confuse the sum and product rules."},"FormulaLatex":"r_1r_2=\\frac{c}{a}\\quad(a\\ne0)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\frac{28}{1}=28$","En":"$\\frac{28}{1}=28$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"بالتفكيك: $(x-4)(x-7)=x^2-11x+28$، وحاصل ضرب الجذرين 28.","En":"Factoring gives $(x-4)(x-7)=x^2-11x+28$; the roots multiply to 28."}},"TrackIds":[10],"CategoryId":9,"PrimarySkillId":43,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"استعمل علاقات فييتا أو اقرأ الجذور من العوامل.","En":"Use Vieta's formulas or read the roots from the factors."},{"Ar":"اقسم الحد الثابت على معامل المربع.","En":"Divide the constant term by the leading coefficient."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"علاقات فييتا تربط حاصل ضرب الجذور بالحد الثابت ومعامل المربع.","En":"Vieta's formulas connect the product of roots to the constant and quadratic coefficient."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"معامل $x^2$ هو $a=1$ والحد الثابت $c=28$.","En":"The leading coefficient is $a=1$ and the constant is $c=28$."},{"Ar":"طبق علاقة فييتا: $r_1r_2=\\frac{28}{1}=28$.","En":"Apply Vieta's relation: $r_1r_2=\\frac{28}{1}=28$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$28$","En":"$28$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط قانون المجموع بقانون الجداء.","En":"Do not confuse the sum and product rules."},"FormulaLatex":"r_1r_2=\\frac{c}{a}\\quad(a\\ne0)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\frac{28}{1}=28$","En":"$\\frac{28}{1}=28$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"بالتفكيك: $(x-4)(x-7)=x^2-11x+28$، وحاصل ضرب الجذرين 28.","En":"Factoring gives $(x-4)(x-7)=x^2-11x+28$; the roots multiply to 28."}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"معامل المربع يساوي 1؛ ضرب الخيار 29 في هذا المعامل لا يعيد الحد الثابت 28.","En":"The leading coefficient is 1; multiplying 29 by it does not recover constant 28."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"معامل المربع يساوي 1؛ ضرب الخيار 31 في هذا المعامل لا يعيد الحد الثابت 28.","En":"The leading coefficient is 1; multiplying 31 by it does not recover constant 28."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"معامل المربع يساوي 1؛ ضرب الخيار 26 في هذا المعامل لا يعيد الحد الثابت 28.","En":"The leading coefficient is 1; multiplying 26 by it does not recover constant 28."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$علاقات فييتا تربط حاصل ضرب الجذور بالحد الثابت ومعامل المربع.

$r_1r_2=\frac{c}{a}\quad(a\ne0)$

1. معامل $x^2$ هو $a=1$ والحد الثابت $c=28$.

2. طبق علاقة فييتا: $r_1r_2=\frac{28}{1}=28$.

$\frac{28}{1}=28$

$28$ بلا وحدة قياس

بالتفكيك: $(x-4)(x-7)=x^2-11x+28$، وحاصل ضرب الجذرين 28.

لا تخلط قانون المجموع بقانون الجداء.$mw$,$mw$Vieta's formulas connect the product of roots to the constant and quadratic coefficient.

$r_1r_2=\frac{c}{a}\quad(a\ne0)$

1. The leading coefficient is $a=1$ and the constant is $c=28$.

2. Apply Vieta's relation: $r_1r_2=\frac{28}{1}=28$.

$\frac{28}{1}=28$

$28$ Dimensionless

Factoring gives $(x-4)(x-7)=x^2-11x+28$; the roots multiply to 28.

Do not confuse the sum and product rules.$mw$),
(503,294,$mw$CE594CC97D0C53B09B94896168ABB521E072BEFF3B309169F94B718FB4BEF2A2$mw$,$mw$b9f6c758220e43467b7d79b2f6fc3256$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":294,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":9,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"احسب مميز \\(x^2+4x+5=0\\).","TitleEn":"Compute the discriminant of \\(x^2+4x+5=0\\).","QuestionTextAr":"احسب مميز \\(x^2+4x+5=0\\).","QuestionTextEn":"Compute the discriminant of \\(x^2+4x+5=0\\).","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: مميّز المعادلة التربيعية أ س² + ب س + ج = 0 هو Δ = ب² − 4أج. في س² + 4س + 5 = 0 لدينا أ = 1، ب = 4، ج = 5. بالتعويض: Δ = 4² − 4 × 1 × 5 = 16 − 20 = -4. إشارة المميز تساعد لاحقاً في تحديد عدد الجذور الحقيقية.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Quadratic discriminant law: For ax² + bx + c = 0, Δ = b² − 4ac. In x² + 4x + 5 = 0, a = 1, b = 4, c = 5. Substitute: Δ = 4² − 4 × 1 × 5 = 16 − 20 = -4. The discriminant sign can then classify real roots.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1165,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"-3","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1166,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"-1","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1167,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"-6","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1168,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"-4","IsCorrect":true}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"استخدم المميز للمعادلة التربيعية.","En":"Use the quadratic discriminant."},{"Ar":"ربّع معامل x ثم اطرح أربعة أمثال حاصل ضرب معامل المربع والثابت.","En":"Square the x coefficient and subtract four times the product of the leading and constant coefficients."}],"Title":{"Ar":"احسب مميز \\(x^2+4x+5=0\\).","En":"Compute the discriminant of \\(x^2+4x+5=0\\)."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"إذا كان المميز -3 فإن إضافة $4ac=20$ تعطي 17 وليس $b^2=16$.","En":"If the discriminant were -3, adding $4ac=20$ would give 17, not $b^2=16$."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"-3"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"إذا كان المميز -1 فإن إضافة $4ac=20$ تعطي 19 وليس $b^2=16$.","En":"If the discriminant were -1, adding $4ac=20$ would give 19, not $b^2=16$."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"-1"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"إذا كان المميز -6 فإن إضافة $4ac=20$ تعطي 14 وليس $b^2=16$.","En":"If the discriminant were -6, adding $4ac=20$ would give 14, not $b^2=16$."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"-6"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"-4"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"احسب مميز \\(x^2+4x+5=0\\).","En":"Compute the discriminant of \\(x^2+4x+5=0\\)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"مميز المعادلة التربيعية يحدد طبيعة جذورها الحقيقية.","En":"A quadratic discriminant determines the nature of its real roots."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"حدد المعاملات: $a=1$ و$b=4$ و$c=5$.","En":"Identify coefficients $a=1$, $b=4$ and $c=5$."},{"Ar":"احسب $b^2=16$ و$4ac=20$ ثم اطرح.","En":"Compute $b^2=16$ and $4ac=20$, then subtract."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$-4$","En":"$-4$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"انتبه إلى إشارة الطرح؛ قد يكون المميز سالباً.","En":"Preserve subtraction; the discriminant may be negative."},"FormulaLatex":"\\Delta=b^2-4ac","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\Delta=4^2-4(1)(5)=-4$","En":"$\\Delta=4^2-4(1)(5)=-4$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$-4+20=16$","En":"$-4+20=16$"}},"TrackIds":[10],"CategoryId":9,"PrimarySkillId":44,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"استخدم المميز للمعادلة التربيعية.","En":"Use the quadratic discriminant."},{"Ar":"ربّع معامل x ثم اطرح أربعة أمثال حاصل ضرب معامل المربع والثابت.","En":"Square the x coefficient and subtract four times the product of the leading and constant coefficients."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"مميز المعادلة التربيعية يحدد طبيعة جذورها الحقيقية.","En":"A quadratic discriminant determines the nature of its real roots."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"حدد المعاملات: $a=1$ و$b=4$ و$c=5$.","En":"Identify coefficients $a=1$, $b=4$ and $c=5$."},{"Ar":"احسب $b^2=16$ و$4ac=20$ ثم اطرح.","En":"Compute $b^2=16$ and $4ac=20$, then subtract."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$-4$","En":"$-4$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"انتبه إلى إشارة الطرح؛ قد يكون المميز سالباً.","En":"Preserve subtraction; the discriminant may be negative."},"FormulaLatex":"\\Delta=b^2-4ac","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\Delta=4^2-4(1)(5)=-4$","En":"$\\Delta=4^2-4(1)(5)=-4$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$-4+20=16$","En":"$-4+20=16$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"إذا كان المميز -3 فإن إضافة $4ac=20$ تعطي 17 وليس $b^2=16$.","En":"If the discriminant were -3, adding $4ac=20$ would give 17, not $b^2=16$."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"إذا كان المميز -1 فإن إضافة $4ac=20$ تعطي 19 وليس $b^2=16$.","En":"If the discriminant were -1, adding $4ac=20$ would give 19, not $b^2=16$."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"إذا كان المميز -6 فإن إضافة $4ac=20$ تعطي 14 وليس $b^2=16$.","En":"If the discriminant were -6, adding $4ac=20$ would give 14, not $b^2=16$."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$مميز المعادلة التربيعية يحدد طبيعة جذورها الحقيقية.

$\Delta=b^2-4ac$

1. حدد المعاملات: $a=1$ و$b=4$ و$c=5$.

2. احسب $b^2=16$ و$4ac=20$ ثم اطرح.

$\Delta=4^2-4(1)(5)=-4$

$-4$ بلا وحدة قياس

$-4+20=16$

انتبه إلى إشارة الطرح؛ قد يكون المميز سالباً.$mw$,$mw$A quadratic discriminant determines the nature of its real roots.

$\Delta=b^2-4ac$

1. Identify coefficients $a=1$, $b=4$ and $c=5$.

2. Compute $b^2=16$ and $4ac=20$, then subtract.

$\Delta=4^2-4(1)(5)=-4$

$-4$ Dimensionless

$-4+20=16$

Preserve subtraction; the discriminant may be negative.$mw$),
(504,295,$mw$268D898A8863A19652CC88E40034D98016AD0B65EE15812449B0795F110D1D5B$mw$,$mw$6b838ddd206c09ec17966063598daad2$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":295,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":9,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"حلّل \\(x^2+9x+20\\) إلى عوامل.","TitleEn":"Factor \\(x^2+9x+20\\).","QuestionTextAr":"حلّل \\(x^2+9x+20\\) إلى عوامل.","QuestionTextEn":"Factor \\(x^2+9x+20\\).","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: لتحليل س² + 9س + 20 نبحث عن عددين مجموعهما 9 وحاصل ضربهما 20. العددان 4 و5 لأن 4 + 5 = 9 و4 × 5 = 20. إذن التحليل (س + 4)(س + 5). التحقق بالتوزيع: س² + (4 + 5)س + 4×5 يعيد المقدار الأصلي.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Factoring rule: To factor x² + 9x + 20, find two numbers with sum 9 and product 20. They are 4 and 5 because 4 + 5 = 9 and 4 × 5 = 20. Therefore the factors are (x + 4)(x + 5). Expanding reproduces x² + 9x + 20.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1169,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"(x+4)(x-5)","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1170,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"(x+1)(x+20)","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1171,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"(x+4)(x+5)","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1172,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"(x-4)(x-5)","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"قارن الحد الخطي والثابت مع صورة حاصل ضرب عاملين.","En":"Compare the linear and constant terms with a product of two factors."},{"Ar":"ابحث عن عددين يحققان شرطي المجموع والجداء معاً.","En":"Find two numbers satisfying both sum and product conditions."}],"Title":{"Ar":"حلّل \\(x^2+9x+20\\) إلى عوامل.","En":"Factor \\(x^2+9x+20\\)."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"عند التوسيع يصبح معامل $x$ هو -1 والثابت -20؛ المطلوب 9 و20 معاً.","En":"Expansion gives linear coefficient -1 and constant -20; both must instead be 9 and 20."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"(x+4)(x-5)"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"عند التوسيع يصبح معامل $x$ هو 21 والثابت 20؛ المطلوب 9 و20 معاً.","En":"Expansion gives linear coefficient 21 and constant 20; both must instead be 9 and 20."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"(x+1)(x+20)"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"(x+4)(x+5)"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"عند التوسيع يصبح معامل $x$ هو -9 والثابت 20؛ المطلوب 9 و20 معاً.","En":"Expansion gives linear coefficient -9 and constant 20; both must instead be 9 and 20."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"(x-4)(x-5)"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"حلّل \\(x^2+9x+20\\) إلى عوامل.","En":"Factor \\(x^2+9x+20\\)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نحلل ثلاثي الحدود الأحادي إلى عاملين باستخدام مجموع العددين وحاصل ضربهما.","En":"Factor a monic trinomial using the sum and product of two numbers."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نحتاج عددين مجموعهما 9 وحاصل ضربهما 20.","En":"Find two integers with sum 9 and product 20."},{"Ar":"العددان 4 و5 يحققان الشرطين، لذا اكتب $(x+4)(x+5)$.","En":"The values 4 and 5 meet both conditions, so write $(x+4)(x+5)$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$(x+4)(x+5)$","En":"$(x+4)(x+5)$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تختَر عاملين يحققان الحد الثابت فقط أو تعكس الإشارات.","En":"Do not choose factors that match only the constant or reverse their signs."},"FormulaLatex":"x^2+(u+v)x+uv=(x+u)(x+v)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$x^2+9x+20=(x+4)(x+5)$","En":"$x^2+9x+20=(x+4)(x+5)$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$4+5=9,\\quad4\\times5=20$","En":"$4+5=9,\\quad4\\times5=20$"}},"TrackIds":[10],"CategoryId":9,"PrimarySkillId":45,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"قارن الحد الخطي والثابت مع صورة حاصل ضرب عاملين.","En":"Compare the linear and constant terms with a product of two factors."},{"Ar":"ابحث عن عددين يحققان شرطي المجموع والجداء معاً.","En":"Find two numbers satisfying both sum and product conditions."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نحلل ثلاثي الحدود الأحادي إلى عاملين باستخدام مجموع العددين وحاصل ضربهما.","En":"Factor a monic trinomial using the sum and product of two numbers."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نحتاج عددين مجموعهما 9 وحاصل ضربهما 20.","En":"Find two integers with sum 9 and product 20."},{"Ar":"العددان 4 و5 يحققان الشرطين، لذا اكتب $(x+4)(x+5)$.","En":"The values 4 and 5 meet both conditions, so write $(x+4)(x+5)$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$(x+4)(x+5)$","En":"$(x+4)(x+5)$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تختَر عاملين يحققان الحد الثابت فقط أو تعكس الإشارات.","En":"Do not choose factors that match only the constant or reverse their signs."},"FormulaLatex":"x^2+(u+v)x+uv=(x+u)(x+v)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$x^2+9x+20=(x+4)(x+5)$","En":"$x^2+9x+20=(x+4)(x+5)$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$4+5=9,\\quad4\\times5=20$","En":"$4+5=9,\\quad4\\times5=20$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"عند التوسيع يصبح معامل $x$ هو -1 والثابت -20؛ المطلوب 9 و20 معاً.","En":"Expansion gives linear coefficient -1 and constant -20; both must instead be 9 and 20."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"عند التوسيع يصبح معامل $x$ هو 21 والثابت 20؛ المطلوب 9 و20 معاً.","En":"Expansion gives linear coefficient 21 and constant 20; both must instead be 9 and 20."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"عند التوسيع يصبح معامل $x$ هو -9 والثابت 20؛ المطلوب 9 و20 معاً.","En":"Expansion gives linear coefficient -9 and constant 20; both must instead be 9 and 20."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$نحلل ثلاثي الحدود الأحادي إلى عاملين باستخدام مجموع العددين وحاصل ضربهما.

$x^2+(u+v)x+uv=(x+u)(x+v)$

1. نحتاج عددين مجموعهما 9 وحاصل ضربهما 20.

2. العددان 4 و5 يحققان الشرطين، لذا اكتب $(x+4)(x+5)$.

$x^2+9x+20=(x+4)(x+5)$

$(x+4)(x+5)$ بلا وحدة قياس

$4+5=9,\quad4\times5=20$

لا تختَر عاملين يحققان الحد الثابت فقط أو تعكس الإشارات.$mw$,$mw$Factor a monic trinomial using the sum and product of two numbers.

$x^2+(u+v)x+uv=(x+u)(x+v)$

1. Find two integers with sum 9 and product 20.

2. The values 4 and 5 meet both conditions, so write $(x+4)(x+5)$.

$x^2+9x+20=(x+4)(x+5)$

$(x+4)(x+5)$ Dimensionless

$4+5=9,\quad4\times5=20$

Do not choose factors that match only the constant or reverse their signs.$mw$),
(505,296,$mw$CC99B6B4B7D096E94167D9820923273D0B8F720942D30293A0B3F088094CCBD3$mw$,$mw$ac1f80c8ca3da6f401db0945d7de65dd$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":296,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":10,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"مجاور الزاوية θ في مثلث قائم 15 والوتر 17، أوجد \\(\\cos\\theta\\).","TitleEn":"Right triangle: adjacent to θ is 15, hypotenuse 17. Find cos θ.","QuestionTextAr":"مجاور الزاوية θ في مثلث قائم 15 والوتر 17، أوجد \\(\\cos\\theta\\).","QuestionTextEn":"Right triangle: adjacent to θ is 15, hypotenuse 17. Find cos θ.","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: cos(θ) = طول الضلع المجاور للزاوية ÷ طول الوتر في المثلث القائم. الضلع المجاور 15 والوتر 17؛ بالتعويض: cos(θ) = 15 ÷ 17 = 15/17. بما أن المجاور أقصر من الوتر فالنتيجة أقل من 1.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Right-triangle cosine rule: cos(θ) = adjacent side ÷ hypotenuse. With adjacent 15 and hypotenuse 17, substitute cos(θ) = 15/17. Since a triangle's leg is shorter than its hypotenuse, this positive ratio is below 1.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1173,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"\\frac{8}{17}","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1174,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"\\frac{8}{15}","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1175,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"\\frac{17}{15}","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1176,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"\\frac{15}{17}","IsCorrect":true}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد النسبة المثلثية التي يطلبها السؤال.","En":"Identify the trigonometric ratio requested."},{"Ar":"استخدم المجاور في البسط والوتر في المقام.","En":"Use the adjacent in the numerator and hypotenuse in the denominator."}],"Title":{"Ar":"مجاور الزاوية θ في مثلث قائم 15 والوتر 17، أوجد \\(\\cos\\theta\\).","En":"Right triangle: adjacent to θ is 15, hypotenuse 17. Find cos θ."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"استُخدم المقابل على الوتر، وهذا جيب الزاوية.","En":"This uses opposite over hypotenuse, which is sine."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"\\frac{8}{17}"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"استُخدم المقابل على المجاور، وهذا ظل الزاوية.","En":"This uses opposite over adjacent, which is tangent."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"\\frac{8}{15}"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"قلبت البسط والمقام؛ هذه مقلوب النسبة المطلوبة.","En":"The numerator and denominator are reversed; this is the reciprocal."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"\\frac{17}{15}"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"\\frac{15}{17}"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"مجاور الزاوية θ في مثلث قائم 15 والوتر 17، أوجد \\(\\cos\\theta\\).","En":"Right triangle: adjacent to θ is 15, hypotenuse 17. Find cos θ."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"يرمز $A$ إلى طول المجاور و$H$ إلى الوتر، والوتر موجب.","En":"Let $A$ denote the adjacent length and $H$ the positive hypotenuse."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"حدد المجاور 15 والوتر 17 بالنسبة إلى الزاوية $\\theta$.","En":"Identify the adjacent 15 and hypotenuse 17 relative to $\\theta$."},{"Ar":"كوّن النسبة بالترتيب الصحيح: $\\frac{15}{17}$.","En":"Form the ratio in the correct order: $\\frac{15}{17}$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\frac{15}{17}$","En":"$\\frac{15}{17}$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعكس البسط والمقام أو تستخدم الضلع غير المطلوب.","En":"Do not reverse numerator and denominator or use the wrong side."},"FormulaLatex":"\\cos\\theta=\\frac{A}{H}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\cos\\theta=\\frac{15}{17}$","En":"$\\cos\\theta=\\frac{15}{17}$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac{15}{17}\\times17=15$","En":"$\\frac{15}{17}\\times17=15$"}},"TrackIds":[10],"CategoryId":10,"PrimarySkillId":48,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد النسبة المثلثية التي يطلبها السؤال.","En":"Identify the trigonometric ratio requested."},{"Ar":"استخدم المجاور في البسط والوتر في المقام.","En":"Use the adjacent in the numerator and hypotenuse in the denominator."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"يرمز $A$ إلى طول المجاور و$H$ إلى الوتر، والوتر موجب.","En":"Let $A$ denote the adjacent length and $H$ the positive hypotenuse."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"حدد المجاور 15 والوتر 17 بالنسبة إلى الزاوية $\\theta$.","En":"Identify the adjacent 15 and hypotenuse 17 relative to $\\theta$."},{"Ar":"كوّن النسبة بالترتيب الصحيح: $\\frac{15}{17}$.","En":"Form the ratio in the correct order: $\\frac{15}{17}$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\frac{15}{17}$","En":"$\\frac{15}{17}$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعكس البسط والمقام أو تستخدم الضلع غير المطلوب.","En":"Do not reverse numerator and denominator or use the wrong side."},"FormulaLatex":"\\cos\\theta=\\frac{A}{H}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\cos\\theta=\\frac{15}{17}$","En":"$\\cos\\theta=\\frac{15}{17}$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac{15}{17}\\times17=15$","En":"$\\frac{15}{17}\\times17=15$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"استُخدم المقابل على الوتر، وهذا جيب الزاوية.","En":"This uses opposite over hypotenuse, which is sine."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"استُخدم المقابل على المجاور، وهذا ظل الزاوية.","En":"This uses opposite over adjacent, which is tangent."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"قلبت البسط والمقام؛ هذه مقلوب النسبة المطلوبة.","En":"The numerator and denominator are reversed; this is the reciprocal."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$يرمز $A$ إلى طول المجاور و$H$ إلى الوتر، والوتر موجب.

$\cos\theta=\frac{A}{H}$

1. حدد المجاور 15 والوتر 17 بالنسبة إلى الزاوية $\theta$.

2. كوّن النسبة بالترتيب الصحيح: $\frac{15}{17}$.

$\cos\theta=\frac{15}{17}$

$\frac{15}{17}$ بلا وحدة قياس

$\frac{15}{17}\times17=15$

لا تعكس البسط والمقام أو تستخدم الضلع غير المطلوب.$mw$,$mw$Let $A$ denote the adjacent length and $H$ the positive hypotenuse.

$\cos\theta=\frac{A}{H}$

1. Identify the adjacent 15 and hypotenuse 17 relative to $\theta$.

2. Form the ratio in the correct order: $\frac{15}{17}$.

$\cos\theta=\frac{15}{17}$

$\frac{15}{17}$ Dimensionless

$\frac{15}{17}\times17=15$

Do not reverse numerator and denominator or use the wrong side.$mw$),
(506,297,$mw$DB7B540560E1B99A50DB46B3D978143FAB7B2B3E8A35048B24DE858107FBEA64$mw$,$mw$fc634ef3bd517fc8f04f1dfd90d39ed4$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":297,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":10,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"مقابل الزاوية θ 8 والمجاور 15 في مثلث قائم، أوجد \\(\\tan\\theta\\).","TitleEn":"Right triangle: opposite θ is 8, adjacent 15. Find tan θ.","QuestionTextAr":"مقابل الزاوية θ 8 والمجاور 15 في مثلث قائم، أوجد \\(\\tan\\theta\\).","QuestionTextEn":"Right triangle: opposite θ is 8, adjacent 15. Find tan θ.","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: tan(θ) = طول الضلع المقابل للزاوية ÷ طول الضلع المجاور، وليس المقابل ÷ الوتر. المعطيات: المقابل 8 والمجاور 15. بالتعويض: tan(θ) = 8 ÷ 15 = 8/15. لا نحتاج حساب طول الوتر لهذا السؤال.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Right-triangle tangent rule: tan(θ) = opposite side ÷ adjacent side, not opposite ÷ hypotenuse. Given opposite 8 and adjacent 15, substitute tan(θ) = 8/15. The hypotenuse is unnecessary for tangent here.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1177,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"\\frac{8}{17}","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1178,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"\\frac{15}{17}","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1179,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"\\frac{8}{15}","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1180,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"\\frac{15}{8}","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد النسبة المثلثية التي يطلبها السؤال.","En":"Identify the trigonometric ratio requested."},{"Ar":"استخدم المقابل في البسط والمجاور في المقام.","En":"Use the opposite in the numerator and adjacent in the denominator."}],"Title":{"Ar":"مقابل الزاوية θ 8 والمجاور 15 في مثلث قائم، أوجد \\(\\tan\\theta\\).","En":"Right triangle: opposite θ is 8, adjacent 15. Find tan θ."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"استُخدم المقابل على الوتر، وهذا جيب الزاوية.","En":"This uses opposite over hypotenuse, which is sine."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"\\frac{8}{17}"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"استُخدم المجاور على الوتر، وهذا جيب التمام.","En":"This uses adjacent over hypotenuse, which is cosine."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"\\frac{15}{17}"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"\\frac{8}{15}"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"قلبت البسط والمقام؛ هذه مقلوب النسبة المطلوبة.","En":"The numerator and denominator are reversed; this is the reciprocal."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"\\frac{15}{8}"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"مقابل الزاوية θ 8 والمجاور 15 في مثلث قائم، أوجد \\(\\tan\\theta\\).","En":"Right triangle: opposite θ is 8, adjacent 15. Find tan θ."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"يرمز $O$ إلى طول المقابل و$A$ إلى المجاور غير الصفري.","En":"Let $O$ denote the opposite length and $A$ the nonzero adjacent length."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"حدد المقابل 8 والمجاور 15 بالنسبة إلى الزاوية $\\theta$.","En":"Identify the opposite 8 and adjacent 15 relative to $\\theta$."},{"Ar":"كوّن النسبة بالترتيب الصحيح: $\\frac{8}{15}$.","En":"Form the ratio in the correct order: $\\frac{8}{15}$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\frac{8}{15}$","En":"$\\frac{8}{15}$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعكس البسط والمقام أو تستخدم الضلع غير المطلوب.","En":"Do not reverse numerator and denominator or use the wrong side."},"FormulaLatex":"\\tan\\theta=\\frac{O}{A}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\tan\\theta=\\frac{8}{15}$","En":"$\\tan\\theta=\\frac{8}{15}$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac{8}{15}\\times15=8$","En":"$\\frac{8}{15}\\times15=8$"}},"TrackIds":[10],"CategoryId":10,"PrimarySkillId":48,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد النسبة المثلثية التي يطلبها السؤال.","En":"Identify the trigonometric ratio requested."},{"Ar":"استخدم المقابل في البسط والمجاور في المقام.","En":"Use the opposite in the numerator and adjacent in the denominator."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"يرمز $O$ إلى طول المقابل و$A$ إلى المجاور غير الصفري.","En":"Let $O$ denote the opposite length and $A$ the nonzero adjacent length."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"حدد المقابل 8 والمجاور 15 بالنسبة إلى الزاوية $\\theta$.","En":"Identify the opposite 8 and adjacent 15 relative to $\\theta$."},{"Ar":"كوّن النسبة بالترتيب الصحيح: $\\frac{8}{15}$.","En":"Form the ratio in the correct order: $\\frac{8}{15}$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\frac{8}{15}$","En":"$\\frac{8}{15}$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعكس البسط والمقام أو تستخدم الضلع غير المطلوب.","En":"Do not reverse numerator and denominator or use the wrong side."},"FormulaLatex":"\\tan\\theta=\\frac{O}{A}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\tan\\theta=\\frac{8}{15}$","En":"$\\tan\\theta=\\frac{8}{15}$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac{8}{15}\\times15=8$","En":"$\\frac{8}{15}\\times15=8$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"استُخدم المقابل على الوتر، وهذا جيب الزاوية.","En":"This uses opposite over hypotenuse, which is sine."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"استُخدم المجاور على الوتر، وهذا جيب التمام.","En":"This uses adjacent over hypotenuse, which is cosine."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"قلبت البسط والمقام؛ هذه مقلوب النسبة المطلوبة.","En":"The numerator and denominator are reversed; this is the reciprocal."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$يرمز $O$ إلى طول المقابل و$A$ إلى المجاور غير الصفري.

$\tan\theta=\frac{O}{A}$

1. حدد المقابل 8 والمجاور 15 بالنسبة إلى الزاوية $\theta$.

2. كوّن النسبة بالترتيب الصحيح: $\frac{8}{15}$.

$\tan\theta=\frac{8}{15}$

$\frac{8}{15}$ بلا وحدة قياس

$\frac{8}{15}\times15=8$

لا تعكس البسط والمقام أو تستخدم الضلع غير المطلوب.$mw$,$mw$Let $O$ denote the opposite length and $A$ the nonzero adjacent length.

$\tan\theta=\frac{O}{A}$

1. Identify the opposite 8 and adjacent 15 relative to $\theta$.

2. Form the ratio in the correct order: $\frac{8}{15}$.

$\tan\theta=\frac{8}{15}$

$\frac{8}{15}$ Dimensionless

$\frac{8}{15}\times15=8$

Do not reverse numerator and denominator or use the wrong side.$mw$),
(507,298,$mw$B327E73C91E1B907C48337BA53DCF8563419D04C0194754963AE9A0F0384E233$mw$,$mw$dda95dab6ca21d5eb1cca916557f0c9d$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":298,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":10,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"ما القيمة الدقيقة لجيب الزاوية 45°؟","TitleEn":"Find the exact sine of angle 45°.","QuestionTextAr":"ما القيمة الدقيقة لجيب الزاوية 45°؟","QuestionTextEn":"Find the exact sine of angle 45°.","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: في مثلث قائم متساوي الساقين 45°–45°–90° يمكن أخذ الساقين 1 و1. بفيثاغورس الوتر = √(1² + 1²) = √2. إذن sin(45°) = المقابل ÷ الوتر = 1/√2 = √2/2 بعد إزالة الجذر من المقام.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Special-triangle rule: In a 45°–45°–90° right triangle, take both legs equal to 1. By Pythagoras, hypotenuse = √(1² + 1²) = √2. Sine is opposite/hypotenuse: sin(45°) = 1/√2 = √2/2 after rationalizing.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1181,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1182,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1183,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"0","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1184,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"\\frac{1}{2}","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"استخدم دائرة الوحدة ذات نصف القطر 1.","En":"Use the unit circle with radius 1."},{"Ar":"حدد الإحداثي الرأسي $y$ للنقطة عند الزاوية المعطاة.","En":"Identify the vertical coordinate $y$ at the given angle."}],"Title":{"Ar":"ما القيمة الدقيقة لجيب الزاوية 45°؟","En":"Find the exact sine of angle 45°."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذه قيمة جيب زاوية 60 درجة، لا 45 درجة؛ راجع الإحداثي الرأسي.","En":"This is the sine of 60 degrees, not 45; check the vertical coordinate."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذه قيمة جيب زاوية 0 درجة، لا 45 درجة؛ راجع الإحداثي الرأسي.","En":"This is the sine of 0 degrees, not 45; check the vertical coordinate."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"0"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذه قيمة جيب زاوية 30 درجة، لا 45 درجة؛ راجع الإحداثي الرأسي.","En":"This is the sine of 30 degrees, not 45; check the vertical coordinate."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"\\frac{1}{2}"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"ما القيمة الدقيقة لجيب الزاوية 45°؟","En":"Find the exact sine of angle 45°."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"على دائرة الوحدة الجيب هو الإحداثي الصادي وجيب التمام هو السيني.","En":"On the unit circle, sine is the y-coordinate and cosine is the x-coordinate."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"النقطة عند زاوية 45 درجة على دائرة الوحدة هي $(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2},\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})$.","En":"The point at 45 degrees on the unit circle is $(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2},\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})$."},{"Ar":"جيب الزاوية هو الإحداثي $y$، أي $\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$.","En":"Sine is the $y$ coordinate, namely $\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$","En":"$\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط بين قيم الجيب وجيب التمام أو بين الزوايا الخاصة.","En":"Do not confuse sine and cosine or the special angles."},"FormulaLatex":"\\sin\\theta=y,\\quad (x,y)=(\\cos\\theta,\\sin\\theta)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\sin45^\\circ=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$","En":"$\\sin45^\\circ=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"تحقق من $(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})^2+(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})^2=1$ مع موضع الزاوية في الربع الأول أو على محوره.","En":"Check $(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})^2+(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})^2=1$ and the angle's location in or on the boundary of the first quadrant."}},"TrackIds":[10],"CategoryId":10,"PrimarySkillId":46,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"استخدم دائرة الوحدة ذات نصف القطر 1.","En":"Use the unit circle with radius 1."},{"Ar":"حدد الإحداثي الرأسي $y$ للنقطة عند الزاوية المعطاة.","En":"Identify the vertical coordinate $y$ at the given angle."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"على دائرة الوحدة الجيب هو الإحداثي الصادي وجيب التمام هو السيني.","En":"On the unit circle, sine is the y-coordinate and cosine is the x-coordinate."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"النقطة عند زاوية 45 درجة على دائرة الوحدة هي $(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2},\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})$.","En":"The point at 45 degrees on the unit circle is $(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2},\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})$."},{"Ar":"جيب الزاوية هو الإحداثي $y$، أي $\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$.","En":"Sine is the $y$ coordinate, namely $\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$","En":"$\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط بين قيم الجيب وجيب التمام أو بين الزوايا الخاصة.","En":"Do not confuse sine and cosine or the special angles."},"FormulaLatex":"\\sin\\theta=y,\\quad (x,y)=(\\cos\\theta,\\sin\\theta)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\sin45^\\circ=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$","En":"$\\sin45^\\circ=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"تحقق من $(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})^2+(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})^2=1$ مع موضع الزاوية في الربع الأول أو على محوره.","En":"Check $(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})^2+(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})^2=1$ and the angle's location in or on the boundary of the first quadrant."}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذه قيمة جيب زاوية 60 درجة، لا 45 درجة؛ راجع الإحداثي الرأسي.","En":"This is the sine of 60 degrees, not 45; check the vertical coordinate."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذه قيمة جيب زاوية 0 درجة، لا 45 درجة؛ راجع الإحداثي الرأسي.","En":"This is the sine of 0 degrees, not 45; check the vertical coordinate."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذه قيمة جيب زاوية 30 درجة، لا 45 درجة؛ راجع الإحداثي الرأسي.","En":"This is the sine of 30 degrees, not 45; check the vertical coordinate."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$على دائرة الوحدة الجيب هو الإحداثي الصادي وجيب التمام هو السيني.

$\sin\theta=y,\quad (x,y)=(\cos\theta,\sin\theta)$

1. النقطة عند زاوية 45 درجة على دائرة الوحدة هي $(\frac{\sqrt{2}}{2},\frac{\sqrt{2}}{2})$.

2. جيب الزاوية هو الإحداثي $y$، أي $\frac{\sqrt{2}}{2}$.

$\sin45^\circ=\frac{\sqrt{2}}{2}$

$\frac{\sqrt{2}}{2}$ بلا وحدة قياس

تحقق من $(\frac{\sqrt{2}}{2})^2+(\frac{\sqrt{2}}{2})^2=1$ مع موضع الزاوية في الربع الأول أو على محوره.

لا تخلط بين قيم الجيب وجيب التمام أو بين الزوايا الخاصة.$mw$,$mw$On the unit circle, sine is the y-coordinate and cosine is the x-coordinate.

$\sin\theta=y,\quad (x,y)=(\cos\theta,\sin\theta)$

1. The point at 45 degrees on the unit circle is $(\frac{\sqrt{2}}{2},\frac{\sqrt{2}}{2})$.

2. Sine is the $y$ coordinate, namely $\frac{\sqrt{2}}{2}$.

$\sin45^\circ=\frac{\sqrt{2}}{2}$

$\frac{\sqrt{2}}{2}$ Dimensionless

Check $(\frac{\sqrt{2}}{2})^2+(\frac{\sqrt{2}}{2})^2=1$ and the angle's location in or on the boundary of the first quadrant.

Do not confuse sine and cosine or the special angles.$mw$),
(508,299,$mw$810722CA25C8DA5CEA56FADC62ADD59286F9C50ACEE547713A72437318C65889$mw$,$mw$ca63a1910b94719e92ae9afec41b7d96$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":299,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":11,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"أوجد \\(f'(4)\\) للدالة \\(f(x)=5x^{5}\\).","TitleEn":"Find f'(4) for \\(f(x)=5x^{5}\\).","QuestionTextAr":"أوجد \\(f'(4)\\) للدالة \\(f(x)=5x^{5}\\).","QuestionTextEn":"Find f'(4) for \\(f(x)=5x^{5}\\).","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: مشتقة أ س^ن هي أ ن س^(ن−1). في f(س) = 5س^5 تكون f'(س) = 5 × 5س^4 = 25س^4. عند س = 4 نحسب f'(4) = 25 × 4^4 = 25 × 256 = 6400. نشتق أولاً ثم نعوّض بقيمة س.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Power rule: d(ax^n)/dx = anx^(n−1). For f(x) = 5x^5, f'(x) = 5 × 5x^4 = 25x^4. Then f'(4) = 25 × 4^4 = 25 × 256 = 6400. Differentiate first, then substitute the given x.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1185,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"6403","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1186,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"6398","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1187,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"6400","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1188,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"6401","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابدأ بقاعدة اشتقاق القوى.","En":"Start with the power rule."},{"Ar":"اشتق الحدود أولاً، ثم عوّض المدخل إن كان المطلوب قيمة عددية.","En":"Differentiate the terms first, then substitute the input if a numerical value is requested."}],"Title":{"Ar":"أوجد \\(f'(4)\\) للدالة \\(f(x)=5x^{5}\\).","En":"Find f'(4) for \\(f(x)=5x^{5}\\)."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الخيار لا يساوي حاصل ضرب معامل المشتقة 25 في 256؛ أعد حساب القوة والضرب.","En":"This choice is not the derivative coefficient 25 times 256; recheck exponentiation and multiplication."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"6403"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الخيار لا يساوي حاصل ضرب معامل المشتقة 25 في 256؛ أعد حساب القوة والضرب.","En":"This choice is not the derivative coefficient 25 times 256; recheck exponentiation and multiplication."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"6398"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"6400"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الخيار لا يساوي حاصل ضرب معامل المشتقة 25 في 256؛ أعد حساب القوة والضرب.","En":"This choice is not the derivative coefficient 25 times 256; recheck exponentiation and multiplication."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"6401"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"أوجد \\(f'(4)\\) للدالة \\(f(x)=5x^{5}\\).","En":"Find f'(4) for \\(f(x)=5x^{5}\\)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"قاعدة القوة وخطية الاشتقاق: نشتق كل حد على حدة، ومشتقة الثابت صفر.","En":"Power rule and derivative linearity: differentiate each term separately; constants differentiate to zero."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"طبق قاعدة القوة: $f'(x)=25x^{4}$.","En":"Apply the power rule: $f'(x)=25x^{4}$."},{"Ar":"عوّض $x=4$: $25\\times4^{4}=6400$.","En":"Substitute $x=4$: $25\\times4^{4}=6400$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$6400$","En":"$6400$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تنس ضرب المعامل في الأس أو تنس إنقاص الأس.","En":"Do not forget to multiply by the exponent or lower it."},"FormulaLatex":"\\frac{d}{dx}(ax^n)=anx^{n-1}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$f'(x)=25x^{4},\\quad f'(4)=6400$","En":"$f'(x)=25x^{4},\\quad f'(4)=6400$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$5\\times5\\times4^{4}=6400$","En":"$5\\times5\\times4^{4}=6400$"}},"TrackIds":[11],"CategoryId":11,"PrimarySkillId":49,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابدأ بقاعدة اشتقاق القوى.","En":"Start with the power rule."},{"Ar":"اشتق الحدود أولاً، ثم عوّض المدخل إن كان المطلوب قيمة عددية.","En":"Differentiate the terms first, then substitute the input if a numerical value is requested."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"قاعدة القوة وخطية الاشتقاق: نشتق كل حد على حدة، ومشتقة الثابت صفر.","En":"Power rule and derivative linearity: differentiate each term separately; constants differentiate to zero."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"طبق قاعدة القوة: $f'(x)=25x^{4}$.","En":"Apply the power rule: $f'(x)=25x^{4}$."},{"Ar":"عوّض $x=4$: $25\\times4^{4}=6400$.","En":"Substitute $x=4$: $25\\times4^{4}=6400$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$6400$","En":"$6400$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تنس ضرب المعامل في الأس أو تنس إنقاص الأس.","En":"Do not forget to multiply by the exponent or lower it."},"FormulaLatex":"\\frac{d}{dx}(ax^n)=anx^{n-1}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$f'(x)=25x^{4},\\quad f'(4)=6400$","En":"$f'(x)=25x^{4},\\quad f'(4)=6400$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$5\\times5\\times4^{4}=6400$","En":"$5\\times5\\times4^{4}=6400$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الخيار لا يساوي حاصل ضرب معامل المشتقة 25 في 256؛ أعد حساب القوة والضرب.","En":"This choice is not the derivative coefficient 25 times 256; recheck exponentiation and multiplication."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الخيار لا يساوي حاصل ضرب معامل المشتقة 25 في 256؛ أعد حساب القوة والضرب.","En":"This choice is not the derivative coefficient 25 times 256; recheck exponentiation and multiplication."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الخيار لا يساوي حاصل ضرب معامل المشتقة 25 في 256؛ أعد حساب القوة والضرب.","En":"This choice is not the derivative coefficient 25 times 256; recheck exponentiation and multiplication."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$قاعدة القوة وخطية الاشتقاق: نشتق كل حد على حدة، ومشتقة الثابت صفر.

$\frac{d}{dx}(ax^n)=anx^{n-1}$

1. طبق قاعدة القوة: $f'(x)=25x^{4}$.

2. عوّض $x=4$: $25\times4^{4}=6400$.

$f'(x)=25x^{4},\quad f'(4)=6400$

$6400$ بلا وحدة قياس

$5\times5\times4^{4}=6400$

لا تنس ضرب المعامل في الأس أو تنس إنقاص الأس.$mw$,$mw$Power rule and derivative linearity: differentiate each term separately; constants differentiate to zero.

$\frac{d}{dx}(ax^n)=anx^{n-1}$

1. Apply the power rule: $f'(x)=25x^{4}$.

2. Substitute $x=4$: $25\times4^{4}=6400$.

$f'(x)=25x^{4},\quad f'(4)=6400$

$6400$ Dimensionless

$5\times5\times4^{4}=6400$

Do not forget to multiply by the exponent or lower it.$mw$),
(509,300,$mw$FC4F14DA6D1273522D5D17233F4C0061C679B20B82FCE9B939D5D7187520045D$mw$,$mw$12d7d69013b8bc9270be85ec54a5a817$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":300,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":11,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"احسب \\(\\int 16x^{3}\\,dx\\).","TitleEn":"Compute \\(\\int 16x^{3}\\,dx\\).","QuestionTextAr":"احسب \\(\\int 16x^{3}\\,dx\\).","QuestionTextEn":"Compute \\(\\int 16x^{3}\\,dx\\).","DetailedSolutionAr":"قانون التكامل غير المحدد للقوى: ∫أ س^ن dس = أ × س^(ن+1)/(ن+1) + C، ما دام ن ≠ −1. لدينا ∫16س^3 dس، نزيد الأس إلى 4 ونقسم المعامل على 4: (16/4)س^4 + C = 4س^4 + C. نضيف ثابت التكامل C لأن التكامل غير محدد.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Indefinite power-integration rule: ∫a x^n dx = a x^(n+1)/(n+1) + C when n ≠ −1. For ∫16x^3 dx, raise the exponent to 4 and divide the coefficient by 4: (16/4)x^4 + C = 4x^4 + C. Include integration constant C.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1189,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"16x^{3}+C","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1190,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"4x^{4}+C","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1191,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"16x^{4}+C","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1192,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"4x^{3}+C","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"استعمل عكس قاعدة الاشتقاق للقوى.","En":"Use the inverse of the derivative power rule."},{"Ar":"ارفع الأس واحداً ثم اقسم المعامل على الأس الجديد.","En":"Increase the exponent by one and divide the coefficient by the new exponent."}],"Title":{"Ar":"احسب \\(\\int 16x^{3}\\,dx\\).","En":"Compute \\(\\int 16x^{3}\\,dx\\)."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"مشتقة هذا الخيار هي $48x^{2}$ لا $16x^{3}$.","En":"This option differentiates to $48x^{2}$, not $16x^{3}$."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"16x^{3}+C"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"4x^{4}+C"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"مشتقة هذا الخيار هي $64x^{3}$ لا $16x^{3}$.","En":"This option differentiates to $64x^{3}$, not $16x^{3}$."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"16x^{4}+C"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"مشتقة هذا الخيار هي $12x^{2}$ لا $16x^{3}$.","En":"This option differentiates to $12x^{2}$, not $16x^{3}$."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"4x^{3}+C"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"احسب \\(\\int 16x^{3}\\,dx\\).","En":"Compute \\(\\int 16x^{3}\\,dx\\)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"التكامل غير المحدد يعكس الاشتقاق؛ نرفع الأس واحداً ونقسم على الأس الجديد ونضيف ثابت التكامل.","En":"Indefinite integration reverses differentiation: increase the power by one, divide by the new power, and add a constant."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"ارفع الأس 3 إلى 4؛ قاعدة القوة صالحة لأن $n\\ne-1$.","En":"Raise exponent 3 to 4; the power rule applies because $n\\ne-1$."},{"Ar":"اقسم المعامل 16 على 4 وأضف ثابت التكامل $C$.","En":"Divide coefficient 16 by 4 and add integration constant $C$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$4x^{4}+C$","En":"$4x^{4}+C$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تنس القسمة على الأس الجديد أو ثابت التكامل.","En":"Do not omit division by the new exponent or the integration constant."},"FormulaLatex":"\\int ax^n\\,dx=\\frac{a}{n+1}x^{n+1}+C\\quad(n\\ne-1)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\int 16x^{3}\\,dx=\\frac{16}{4}x^{4}+C$","En":"$\\int 16x^{3}\\,dx=\\frac{16}{4}x^{4}+C$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(4x^{4}+C)'=16x^{3}$","En":"$(4x^{4}+C)'=16x^{3}$"}},"TrackIds":[12],"CategoryId":11,"PrimarySkillId":50,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"استعمل عكس قاعدة الاشتقاق للقوى.","En":"Use the inverse of the derivative power rule."},{"Ar":"ارفع الأس واحداً ثم اقسم المعامل على الأس الجديد.","En":"Increase the exponent by one and divide the coefficient by the new exponent."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"التكامل غير المحدد يعكس الاشتقاق؛ نرفع الأس واحداً ونقسم على الأس الجديد ونضيف ثابت التكامل.","En":"Indefinite integration reverses differentiation: increase the power by one, divide by the new power, and add a constant."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"ارفع الأس 3 إلى 4؛ قاعدة القوة صالحة لأن $n\\ne-1$.","En":"Raise exponent 3 to 4; the power rule applies because $n\\ne-1$."},{"Ar":"اقسم المعامل 16 على 4 وأضف ثابت التكامل $C$.","En":"Divide coefficient 16 by 4 and add integration constant $C$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$4x^{4}+C$","En":"$4x^{4}+C$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تنس القسمة على الأس الجديد أو ثابت التكامل.","En":"Do not omit division by the new exponent or the integration constant."},"FormulaLatex":"\\int ax^n\\,dx=\\frac{a}{n+1}x^{n+1}+C\\quad(n\\ne-1)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\int 16x^{3}\\,dx=\\frac{16}{4}x^{4}+C$","En":"$\\int 16x^{3}\\,dx=\\frac{16}{4}x^{4}+C$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(4x^{4}+C)'=16x^{3}$","En":"$(4x^{4}+C)'=16x^{3}$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"مشتقة هذا الخيار هي $48x^{2}$ لا $16x^{3}$.","En":"This option differentiates to $48x^{2}$, not $16x^{3}$."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"مشتقة هذا الخيار هي $64x^{3}$ لا $16x^{3}$.","En":"This option differentiates to $64x^{3}$, not $16x^{3}$."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"مشتقة هذا الخيار هي $12x^{2}$ لا $16x^{3}$.","En":"This option differentiates to $12x^{2}$, not $16x^{3}$."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$التكامل غير المحدد يعكس الاشتقاق؛ نرفع الأس واحداً ونقسم على الأس الجديد ونضيف ثابت التكامل.

$\int ax^n\,dx=\frac{a}{n+1}x^{n+1}+C\quad(n\ne-1)$

1. ارفع الأس 3 إلى 4؛ قاعدة القوة صالحة لأن $n\ne-1$.

2. اقسم المعامل 16 على 4 وأضف ثابت التكامل $C$.

$\int 16x^{3}\,dx=\frac{16}{4}x^{4}+C$

$4x^{4}+C$ بلا وحدة قياس

$(4x^{4}+C)'=16x^{3}$

لا تنس القسمة على الأس الجديد أو ثابت التكامل.$mw$,$mw$Indefinite integration reverses differentiation: increase the power by one, divide by the new power, and add a constant.

$\int ax^n\,dx=\frac{a}{n+1}x^{n+1}+C\quad(n\ne-1)$

1. Raise exponent 3 to 4; the power rule applies because $n\ne-1$.

2. Divide coefficient 16 by 4 and add integration constant $C$.

$\int 16x^{3}\,dx=\frac{16}{4}x^{4}+C$

$4x^{4}+C$ Dimensionless

$(4x^{4}+C)'=16x^{3}$

Do not omit division by the new exponent or the integration constant.$mw$),
