0 by 2."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$15$","En":"$15$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعد الزوج نفسه مرتين.","En":"Do not count each pair twice."},"FormulaLatex":"\\binom n2=\\frac{n(n-1)}2","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\binom{6}2=\\frac{6(6-1)}2=15$","En":"$\\binom{6}2=\\frac{6(6-1)}2=15$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$15\\times2=30$","En":"$15\\times2=30$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا العدد يقابل 26 اختياراً مرتباً، بينما العدد الصحيح للاختيارات المرتبة 30.","En":"This implies 26 ordered selections, but there are 30."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا العدد يقابل 32 اختياراً مرتباً، بينما العدد الصحيح للاختيارات المرتبة 30.","En":"This implies 32 ordered selections, but there are 30."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا العدد يقابل 36 اختياراً مرتباً، بينما العدد الصحيح للاختيارات المرتبة 30.","En":"This implies 36 ordered selections, but there are 30."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$نستخدم التوافيق لأن ترتيب الطالبين لا يغيّر الزوج المختار.

$\binom n2=\frac{n(n-1)}2$

1. للاختيار الأول 6 إمكانات، وللثاني 5 بعد استبعاد الأول.

2. كل زوج غير مرتب يُعد مرتين؛ اقسم 30 على 2.

$\binom{6}2=\frac{6(6-1)}2=15$

$15$ طريقة

$15\times2=30$

لا تعد الزوج نفسه مرتين.$mw$,$mw$Use combinations because swapping the students does not change the selected pair.

$\binom n2=\frac{n(n-1)}2$

1. There are 6 choices for the first student and 5 for the second, excluding the first.

2. Each unordered pair is counted twice; divide 30 by 2.

$\binom{6}2=\frac{6(6-1)}2=15$

$15$ Ways

$15\times2=30$

Do not count each pair twice.$mw$),
(513,305,$mw$2221926DFE7BE5CDC3DE6A521CB5B9EDF618AC7756A80914D626D647C2EFB1A8$mw$,$mw$781ab523218cd641b91f913f00ac9192$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":305,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":9,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"ما حاصل ضرب جذري \\(x^2-13x+40=0\\)؟","TitleEn":"What is the product of the roots of \\(x^2-13x+40=0\\)?","QuestionTextAr":"ما حاصل ضرب جذري \\(x^2-13x+40=0\\)؟","QuestionTextEn":"What is the product of the roots of \\(x^2-13x+40=0\\)?","DetailedSolutionAr":"قانون فييتا لمعادلة تربيعية أ س² + ب س + ج = 0: حاصل ضرب الجذرين = ج ÷ أ. في س² − 13س + 40 = 0 معامل س² هو 1 والحد الثابت 40، لذا حاصل الضرب = 40 ÷ 1 = 40. التحقق: التحليل (س − 5)(س − 8) يعطي الجذرين 5 و8 ومنتجهما 40.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Vieta's theorem: For ax² + bx + c = 0, the product of the two roots is c/a. In x² − 13x + 40 = 0, a = 1 and c = 40, so root product = 40/1 = 40. Check: factoring as (x − 5)(x − 8) yields roots 5, 8 with product 40.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1209,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"41","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1210,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"43","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1211,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"38","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1212,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"40","IsCorrect":true}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد معاملات المعادلة التربيعية.","En":"Identify the quadratic coefficients."},{"Ar":"اقسم الحد الثابت على معامل x².","En":"Divide the constant term by the coefficient of x squared."}],"Title":{"Ar":"ما حاصل ضرب جذري \\(x^2-13x+40=0\\)؟","En":"What is the product of the roots of \\(x^2-13x+40=0\\)?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"معامل المربع يساوي 1؛ ضرب الخيار 41 في هذا المعامل لا يعيد الحد الثابت 40.","En":"The leading coefficient is 1; multiplying 41 by it does not recover constant 40."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"41"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"معامل المربع يساوي 1؛ ضرب الخيار 43 في هذا المعامل لا يعيد الحد الثابت 40.","En":"The leading coefficient is 1; multiplying 43 by it does not recover constant 40."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"43"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"معامل المربع يساوي 1؛ ضرب الخيار 38 في هذا المعامل لا يعيد الحد الثابت 40.","En":"The leading coefficient is 1; multiplying 38 by it does not recover constant 40."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"38"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"40"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"ما حاصل ضرب جذري \\(x^2-13x+40=0\\)؟","En":"What is the product of the roots of \\(x^2-13x+40=0\\)?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"حسب علاقات فييتا، حاصل ضرب الجذرين يساوي الحد الثابت على معامل المربع.","En":"By Vieta's formulas, the product of roots equals the constant divided by the leading coefficient."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"معامل $x^2$ هو $a=1$ والحد الثابت $c=40$.","En":"The leading coefficient is $a=1$ and the constant is $c=40$."},{"Ar":"طبق علاقة فييتا: $r_1r_2=\\frac{40}{1}=40$.","En":"Apply Vieta's relation: $r_1r_2=\\frac{40}{1}=40$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$40$","En":"$40$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط حاصل الضرب مع مجموع الجذور.","En":"Do not confuse the root product with their sum."},"FormulaLatex":"r_1r_2=\\frac{c}{a}\\quad(a\\ne0)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\frac{40}1=40$","En":"$\\frac{40}1=40$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"بالتفكيك: $(x-5)(x-8)=x^2-13x+40$، وحاصل ضرب الجذرين 40.","En":"Factoring gives $(x-5)(x-8)=x^2-13x+40$; the roots multiply to 40."}},"TrackIds":[10],"CategoryId":9,"PrimarySkillId":43,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد معاملات المعادلة التربيعية.","En":"Identify the quadratic coefficients."},{"Ar":"اقسم الحد الثابت على معامل x².","En":"Divide the constant term by the coefficient of x squared."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"حسب علاقات فييتا، حاصل ضرب الجذرين يساوي الحد الثابت على معامل المربع.","En":"By Vieta's formulas, the product of roots equals the constant divided by the leading coefficient."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"معامل $x^2$ هو $a=1$ والحد الثابت $c=40$.","En":"The leading coefficient is $a=1$ and the constant is $c=40$."},{"Ar":"طبق علاقة فييتا: $r_1r_2=\\frac{40}{1}=40$.","En":"Apply Vieta's relation: $r_1r_2=\\frac{40}{1}=40$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$40$","En":"$40$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط حاصل الضرب مع مجموع الجذور.","En":"Do not confuse the root product with their sum."},"FormulaLatex":"r_1r_2=\\frac{c}{a}\\quad(a\\ne0)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\frac{40}1=40$","En":"$\\frac{40}1=40$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"بالتفكيك: $(x-5)(x-8)=x^2-13x+40$، وحاصل ضرب الجذرين 40.","En":"Factoring gives $(x-5)(x-8)=x^2-13x+40$; the roots multiply to 40."}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"معامل المربع يساوي 1؛ ضرب الخيار 41 في هذا المعامل لا يعيد الحد الثابت 40.","En":"The leading coefficient is 1; multiplying 41 by it does not recover constant 40."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"معامل المربع يساوي 1؛ ضرب الخيار 43 في هذا المعامل لا يعيد الحد الثابت 40.","En":"The leading coefficient is 1; multiplying 43 by it does not recover constant 40."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"معامل المربع يساوي 1؛ ضرب الخيار 38 في هذا المعامل لا يعيد الحد الثابت 40.","En":"The leading coefficient is 1; multiplying 38 by it does not recover constant 40."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$حسب علاقات فييتا، حاصل ضرب الجذرين يساوي الحد الثابت على معامل المربع.

$r_1r_2=\frac{c}{a}\quad(a\ne0)$

1. معامل $x^2$ هو $a=1$ والحد الثابت $c=40$.

2. طبق علاقة فييتا: $r_1r_2=\frac{40}{1}=40$.

$\frac{40}1=40$

$40$ بلا وحدة قياس

بالتفكيك: $(x-5)(x-8)=x^2-13x+40$، وحاصل ضرب الجذرين 40.

لا تخلط حاصل الضرب مع مجموع الجذور.$mw$,$mw$By Vieta's formulas, the product of roots equals the constant divided by the leading coefficient.

$r_1r_2=\frac{c}{a}\quad(a\ne0)$

1. The leading coefficient is $a=1$ and the constant is $c=40$.

2. Apply Vieta's relation: $r_1r_2=\frac{40}{1}=40$.

$\frac{40}1=40$

$40$ Dimensionless

Factoring gives $(x-5)(x-8)=x^2-13x+40$; the roots multiply to 40.

Do not confuse the root product with their sum.$mw$);
DO $audit$
DECLARE b record; d "CurriculumDraftItems"%ROWTYPE; p "Problems"%ROWTYPE; tr int; sk int; n int; actor int;
BEGIN
 FOR b IN SELECT * FROM reviewed_batch ORDER BY source LOOP
  PERFORM pg_advisory_xact_lock(-b.source::bigint);
  SELECT * INTO STRICT d FROM "CurriculumDraftItems" WHERE "Id"=b.draft FOR UPDATE;
  SELECT * INTO STRICT p FROM "Problems" WHERE "Id"=b.source FOR UPDATE;
  PERFORM 1 FROM "QuestionOptions" WHERE "ProblemId"=b.source FOR UPDATE;
  actor:=d."OwnerUserId"; tr:=(b.wizard->'TrackIds'->>0)::int; sk:=(b.wizard->>'PrimarySkillId')::int;
  IF d."SourceProblemId" IS DISTINCT FROM b.source OR d."Revision"<>0 OR d."EditorialStatus"<>'Draft' OR d."PublishedProblemId" IS NOT NULL OR d."SourceFingerprint" IS DISTINCT FROM b.fp OR md5(d."WizardJson") IS DISTINCT FROM b.draft_hash OR upper(encode(sha256(decode(b.source_hex,'hex')),'hex'))<>b.fp OR (SELECT json_build_object('Id',pp."Id",'StageId',pp."StageId",'CategoryId',pp."CategoryId",'Points',pp."Points",'TitleAr',pp."TitleAr",'TitleEn',pp."TitleEn",'QuestionTextAr',pp."QuestionTextAr",'QuestionTextEn',pp."QuestionTextEn",'DetailedSolutionAr',pp."DetailedSolutionAr",'DetailedSolutionEn',pp."DetailedSolutionEn",'YoutubeSolutionUrl',pp."YoutubeSolutionUrl",'EditorialDetailsJson',pp."EditorialDetailsJson",'Options',(select json_agg(json_build_object('Id',o."Id",'Order',o."Order",'LatexCode',o."LatexCode",'IsCorrect',o."IsCorrect") order by o."Order",o."Id") from "QuestionOptions" o where o."ProblemId"=pp."Id"))::jsonb FROM "Problems" pp WHERE pp."Id"=b.source) IS DISTINCT FROM b.snapshot THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Source/draft conflict: %',b.draft; END IF;
  IF NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "Users" WHERE "Id"=actor AND "Role"='Admin' AND "IsActive" AND NOT "StaffSetupPending") OR (SELECT count(*) FROM "CurriculumDraftItems" WHERE "SourceProblemId"=b.source AND "EditorialStatus" NOT IN ('Published','Withdrawn'))<>1 THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Owner/open-draft conflict: %',b.draft; END IF;
  PERFORM 1 FROM "LearningTracks" WHERE "Id"=tr FOR UPDATE;
  IF NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "LearningTracks" WHERE "Id"=tr AND "StageId"=p."StageId" AND "IsPublished" AND "Revision"<2147483647) OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "Categories" WHERE "Id"=p."CategoryId" AND "StageId"=p."StageId") OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "CurriculumSkills" s JOIN "CurriculumDomains" dm ON dm."Id"=s."DomainId" WHERE s."Id"=sk AND s."StageId"=p."StageId" AND s."CategoryId"=p."CategoryId" AND s."IsPublished" AND dm."IsPublished") OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "LearningTrackCategories" WHERE "TrackId"=tr AND "CategoryId"=p."CategoryId") OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "LearningTrackSkills" WHERE "TrackId"=tr AND "SkillId"=sk) OR (SELECT array_agg("TrackId" ORDER BY "TrackId") FROM "LearningTrackProblems" WHERE "ProblemId"=b.source) IS DISTINCT FROM ARRAY[tr] OR (SELECT array_agg("SkillId" ORDER BY "SkillId") FROM "CurriculumProblemSkills" WHERE "ProblemId"=b.source) IS DISTINCT FROM ARRAY[sk] OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "CurriculumProblemSkills" WHERE "ProblemId"=b.source AND "SkillId"=sk AND "IsPrimary") THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Scope conflict: %',b.draft; END IF;
  IF EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "Problems" q WHERE q."Id"<>b.source AND q."StageId"=p."StageId" AND (upper(regexp_replace(btrim(q."QuestionTextAr"),'[[:space:]]+',' ','g'))=upper(regexp_replace(btrim(p."QuestionTextAr"),'[[:space:]]+',' ','g')) OR upper(regexp_replace(btrim(q."QuestionTextEn"),'[[:space:]]+',' ','g'))=upper(regexp_replace(btrim(p."QuestionTextEn"),'[[:space:]]+',' ','g')))) THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Duplicate: %',b.draft; END IF;
  IF b.wizard#>>'{Question,Ar}' IS DISTINCT FROM p."QuestionTextAr" OR b.wizard#>>'{Question,En}' IS DISTINCT FROM p."QuestionTextEn" OR length(b.flat_ar)>12000 OR length(b.flat_en)>12000 THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Question/length conflict: %',b.draft; END IF;
  UPDATE "Problems" SET "TitleAr"=b.wizard#>>'{Title,Ar}',"TitleEn"=b.wizard#>>'{Title,En}',"DetailedSolutionAr"=b.flat_ar,"DetailedSolutionEn"=b.flat_en,"EditorialDetailsJson"=b.metadata WHERE "Id"=b.source;
  UPDATE "CurriculumDraftItems" SET "WizardJson"=b.wizard::text,"EditorialStatus"='Published',"Revision"=4,"SubmittedAtUtc"=now(),"ReviewedAtUtc"=now(),"ReviewedByUserId"=actor,"ReviewNote"='Owner-authorized SQL maintenance; AI educational review and source-locked verification. Existing draft owner recorded for attribution; no API login.',"PublishedAtUtc"=now(),"PublishedProblemId"=b.source WHERE "Id"=b.draft;
  UPDATE "LearningTracks" SET "Revision"="Revision"+1 WHERE "Id"=tr;
  INSERT INTO "PlatformActivityEvents"("ActorUserId","ActorRole","Action","Resource","ResourceId","Origin","CreatedAtUtc") SELECT actor,'Admin',action,'EditorialProblem',b.draft::text,'owner_sql',now() FROM unnest(ARRAY['EditorialDraftEdited','EditorialDraftSubmitted','EditorialDraftApproved','EditorialAmendmentPublished']) action;
 END LOOP;
END $audit$;
COMMIT;
